    // 鈹€鈹€鈹€ ImageElement (Bug B2: BoxFit preservation) 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€
    test('ImageElement round-trip preserves BoxFit.cover (Bug B2)', () {
      const element = ImageElement(
